{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>I.</b> These are the words of the prophet, which HaShem said to him concerning himself." "<b>and I will keep you.</b> That no harm shall touch you." "<b>לברית עולם [should read עם].</b> To establish a covenant with, and likewise elsewhere: לברית עם להקים ארץ (Isaiah 49:8)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {2 "The bracketed note צ״ל עם ('should read עם') appears in the source, indicating a textual correction to the lemma."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:31.594515309Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}